    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ce2fc8be0ca148b4e08d0fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标是成为赛马娘界的“王牌”。\n作为不被眷顾之人的先驱者，\n葛城王牌开始奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d14f26e141a52139b1a8903531100285a5bd6cac938a1ce3aaf2d36b9a15066",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76597dd8257f54a58f93e38d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9e4072722cb6f2eb3e97ba64cbc93108581fdaeadfafffe3e9a7f35f6bb9a9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a9c8f83f794c344b7bf7336",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园有许多备受眷顾的选手。\n能在比赛中活跃的人，\n都拥有天生才能或高贵的家世。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f298b1f910c3761251d5a1a7509dd7f625ce3eddcefb0cab0c89f45bffb7787",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4288371dcdf94a8be515d340",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌的朋友们\n刚入学时还相当好胜，\n现在因这残酷的现实而放弃竞争。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f05f477028738e1b5f5bf69312a4d1b1bfd46ca002c88bd05150c29655a4a96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20fb51b4005716b1def479c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌则是再次鼓起干劲。\n她要顺利跑完出道战，\n证明“我们也能办得到！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "624cb0097392ee694f465829a515095bb8246651bfbeb363bc2d817ef3fc150e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce7d4e7a93cbfe987798a0f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战即将到来。\n葛城王牌和训练员一起\n正准备踏出第一步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10f9978ec724f37a0bb0925d853996da4f4ab3e3e27ec28f6882784c3b95f497",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:687a4b66fd764d2029545c82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相邻的现实",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b7d964adf9219815d0f6ad3bfde5f605984fc9c5366b4c1e31a14b09b03592f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:967cdd7f4e7b00132c48d4bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104402.json",
      "json_path": [
